import examples/bim-slice/bim_editor_core.dl

function check modify click {boolean:passed} named {a string:caption}:
    execute:
        if passed = false:
            print ((the string form of "FAIL: ") + caption) as a line
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 1)
        print ((the string form of "PASS: ") + caption) as a line

set editor to a new bim editor
set editTarget to the address of editor
set lineId to add bim line on editor's levelId from (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0) to (a cad vector2 with x 2.0 and y 0.0) to (the address of (editor's documentValue's current))
select bim editor bim sketch picked numbered lineId in editTarget
set originalUndo to the length of (editor's documentValue's undoStack's values)
set originalRedo to the length of (editor's documentValue's redoStack's values)
ignore start bim editor modify command 2025 in editTarget
set editor's moveStage to 2
set editor's moveBase to a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0
set editor's snap to the bim snap (a cad vector2 with x 6.0 and y 0.0) labelled "Free"
set editor's modify's count to 3
set editor's modify's typed to true
set editor's numeric to the string form of "3/"
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
check modify click ((the length of (editor's documentValue's current's sketches's values)) = 1) named (the string form of "mouse refuses incomplete array count without creating copies")
check modify click ((editor's moveStage = 2) and (editor's numeric = (the string form of "3/"))) named (the string form of "invalid array click preserves editable tool input")
set editor's numeric to the string form of "2.5"
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
check modify click ((the length of (editor's documentValue's current's sketches's values)) = 1) named (the string form of "mouse refuses fractional array count")

ignore start bim editor modify command 2016 in editTarget
set editor's moveStage to 3
set editor's turnStart to 1.0
set editor's modify's factor to 2.0
set editor's modify's typed to true
set editor's numeric to the string form of "2/"
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
check modify click (editor's moveStage = 3) named (the string form of "mouse refuses incomplete scale factor without advancing the tool")
set editor's numeric to the string form of "0"
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
set unchangedLine to the item at (the bim sketch index of lineId in editor's documentValue's current)'s position in (editor's documentValue's current's sketches's values)
check modify click (((the item at 1 in (unchangedLine's points's values))'s x) = 2.0) named (the string form of "invalid scale clicks do not reuse the last positive factor")
check modify click (((the length of (editor's documentValue's undoStack's values)) = originalUndo) and ((the length of (editor's documentValue's redoStack's values)) = originalRedo)) named (the string form of "invalid numeric clicks preserve undo and redo")

ignore start bim editor modify command 2390 in editTarget
set editor's numeric to the string form of "-1"
set editor's modify's typed to true
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 0.0
set editor's snap to the bim snap editor's pointerLocation labelled "Free"
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
check modify click ((editor's tool = bim chamfer tool) and (editor's moveStage = 0)) named (the string form of "mouse refuses negative chamfer distance before picking geometry")
ignore start bim editor modify command 2017 in editTarget
set editor's numeric to the string form of "1/"
set editor's modify's typed to true
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
check modify click ((editor's tool = bim fillet tool) and (editor's moveStage = 0)) named (the string form of "mouse refuses incomplete fillet radius before picking geometry")

set editor's tool to bim move tool
set editor's moveStage to 2
set editor's moveBase to a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 3.0 and y 4.0
set editor's numeric to the string form of "5"
set editor's modify's axis to 1
check modify click (update bim editor numeric point in editTarget) named (the string form of "scalar input accepts a locked X direction")
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 5.0 and y 0.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "X lock preserves the complete typed distance")
set editor's modify's axis to 2
ignore update bim editor numeric point in editTarget
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 5.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "Y lock preserves the complete typed distance")
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 3.0 and y 0.0
ignore update bim editor numeric point in editTarget
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 5.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "Y lock supplies its own direction when pointer projection is zero")
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 3.0 and y 4.0
set editor's modify's axis to 0
set editor's orthoHeld to true
ignore update bim editor numeric point in editTarget
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 5.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "held ortho constrains scalar direction before normalization")
set editor's orthoHeld to false
set editor's orthoOn to true
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 4.0 and y 3.0
ignore update bim editor numeric point in editTarget
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 5.0 and y 0.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "latched ortho constrains scalar direction before normalization")
set editor's numeric to the string form of "@3,4"
ignore update bim editor numeric point in editTarget
check modify click ((the cad distance from editor's snap's point to (a cad vector2 with x 3.0 and y 4.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "explicit relative coordinates remain exact while ortho is on")

set editor's orthoOn to false
set editor's tool to bim rotate tool
set editor's moveStage to 3
set editor's turnStart to 0.0
set editor's numeric to the string form of "90"
set editor's modify's typed to true
set editor's modify's copyMode to false
set editor's pointerLocation to a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 1.0
set editor's snap to the bim snap editor's pointerLocation labelled "Free"
begin bim transaction in (the address of (editor's documentValue))
press bim editor pointer in editTarget
set turnedLine to the item at (the bim sketch index of lineId in editor's documentValue's current)'s position in (editor's documentValue's current's sketches's values)
check modify click ((the cad distance from (the item at 1 in (turnedLine's points's values)) to (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 2.0)) < 1e-9) named (the string form of "mouse confirms typed rotation instead of the pointer angle")
